Package: ACSloadR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for accessing the U.S. Census Bureau's American Community Survey for labor market information
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "David", "Schmidt",
      email = "deschmidt@detr.nv.gov",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: The Census Bureau's American Community Survey provides granular detail about populations throughout the United States.
    This data is readily available, but not always formatted consistently for use in providing labor market information. This package
    helps to bridge that gap by providing tools to streamline access and use of the ACS to generate insights into local labor markets.
